      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "This is the second report of a case in which a uterine myoma, one of the most common benign tumours of women, was the cause of a lumbosacral plexus neuropathy. The possibility of uterine myoma should be considered in the differential diagnosis of neuropathy of the lumbosacral plexus in women."},
